OL,3,GNEWSAReleased prisoner death prompts
OL,4,Amental health plea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner has called for prisoners to
OL,7,Fhave mental health checks before their
OL,8,Frelease after a man took his own life
OL,9,Fwithin a week of leaving jail.
OL,11,FFrancis Conlin, 23, from Middlesbrough,
OL,12,Fwas released from left HMP Doncaster on
OL,13,F30 September 2024 and died seven days
OL,14,Flater. His inquest heard he had a
OL,15,Fhistory of mental health issues and
OL,16,Fsubstance abuse and was thought to have
OL,17,Fautism.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
