OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1793195786
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAReleased prisoner death prompts
OL,4,Amental health plea
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeesside and Hartlepool coroner Paul
OL,7,FAppleton said the prison had followed a
OL,8,Fnational checklist regarding physical
OL,9,Fhealth on the day of release, but it
OL,10,Fdid not include any questions or
OL,11,Fprompts about mental health.
OL,13,FNHS England told the coroner such
OL,14,Fchecks should have been part of an
OL,15,Fearlier release planning document.
